        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Hinterland, Hinterland: Orc Lords\n- Companies: Tilted Mill Entertainment\n- Concepts: high fantasy role-playing video games, city-building elements, Orc characters, orcs\n\nFacts:\n- Hinterland is a high fantasy role-playing video game with city-building elements by Tilted Mill Entertainment.\n- In March 2009, Hinterland: Orc Lords was released to digital distribution and retail as a cumulative expansion for Hinterland.\n- Hinterland: Orc Lords primarily added the ability to play as Orc characters.\n- An orc, also spelled ork, is a fictional humanoid creature in a fantasy race akin to goblins.",
